																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"712290127331728395","clan_steamid":"103582791475538230","event_name":"Dev Blog #91: F9F-2 Panther Cockpit","event_type":28,"appid":247970,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793116560,"rtime32_end_time":1793119800,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Inside the F9F-2 Panther cockpit: instruments, controls, and emergency systems.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"\u041a\u0430\u0431\u0438\u043d\u0430 F9F-2 Panther: \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0431\u043e\u0440\u044b, \u043e\u0440\u0433\u0430\u043d\u044b \u0443\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0438 \u0430\u0432\u0430\u0440\u0438\u0439\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0441\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043c\u044b.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"15c5a595af305e307a8b9d51cb0d4d4e7711b1d7.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"70a1de7f2c2663735eed13e4fced0b695c928828.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"3c40d2329fb92ea03f68dac6f320b56252c50f68.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"0a2eed9d8da9e734b53aba3126d1da3a58de53ac.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"clone_from_event_gid\":\"703282384630450941\",\"clone_from_sale_enabled\":false,\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"712290127331728396","clanid":"46016822","posterid":"0","headline":"Dev Blog #91: F9F-2 Panther Cockpit","posttime":1793116617,"updatetime":1793116617,"body":"[p][b]Greetings, comrades![\/b][\/p][p][\/p][p]Today, we continue our extensive coverage of [i]Deck Ops[\/i], the expansion for [i]Korea: IL-2 Series[\/i].[\/p][p]This time, we're returning to a Dev Blog format we haven't used in quite a while. But it might just be one of the most interesting kinds of Dev Blog.[\/p][p]In these issues, we take an in-depth look at the places where pilots experience some of the most thrilling moments of their lives\u2014and which you spend most of your time looking at while flying in the simulator. We're talking about cockpits.[\/p][p]And in this issue, we're going to take a close look at the F9F-2 Panther's cockpit.[\/p][p]The first man to travel into space flew the MiG-15. Today, we'll explore the cockpit of an aircraft flown by the first man to set foot on the Moon.[\/p][p]We covered the aircraft as a whole, as well as Armstrong's experience flying it, in [url=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/news\/app\/247970\/view\/719043624313030861?l=english\"]Dev Blog #88[\/url]. In this issue, though, we'll delve into the fascinating details of its cockpit layout and equipment.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/6f3f41e2c11aae6b9f8b8b89d29e34a717f9c0ed.png\"][\/img][\/p][p]As a carrier-based aircraft, the Panther was designed under strict dimensional constraints imposed by carrier operations. Its fuselage was more compact, and its cockpit noticeably narrower than, for example, that of the F-86 Sabre. Pilots noted that there was very little room around their shoulders and elbows inside the Panther, with the instrument panels positioned closer to them.[\/p][p]Compared with the Sabre, there was also less headroom and poorer rearward visibility. Both were consequences of the more streamlined canopy, which sat lower and blended more closely into the fuselage contours.[\/p][p]As usual, we'll begin our tour of the cockpit instruments at the front\u2014with the gunsight.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/1e2c002fff04f67be624584d032e2d1af2cf6f44.png\"][\/img][\/p][p]The familiar outlines of the K-14 gunsight are easy to recognize. This sight was widely fitted to World War II piston-engined aircraft, including the F-51 Mustang. However, the Panther's sight also had several features typical of naval aviation gunsights. Its range-adjustment drum was enclosed in a housing, and its rotation was transmitted through a special flexible shaft rather than a cable. It also had different ballistic settings designed for 20 mm cannons. This version was designated the Mark 8. In addition, the sight allowed the pilot to switch the reticle between modes for fixed forward-firing weapons and external ordnance.[\/p][p]To the left of the gunsight, on the glare shield above the instrument panel, was the armament control panel. Depending on the aircraft variant, it controlled both the fixed forward-firing armament and externally carried weapons.[\/p][p]A magnetic compass was positioned on the right.[\/p][p]Looking down and slightly to the left, you can easily spot two forked handles.[\/p][p]These were easily the most conspicuous features in the entire cockpit, and they operated in a rather interesting way. Both handles were used to open the canopy.[\/p][p]The smaller one, white with a red tab, was used to open and close the canopy under normal conditions.[\/p][p]In an emergency, the red tab on this handle allowed the pilot to jettison the canopy using the hydraulic system.[\/p][p]If the hydraulic system failed for any reason, however, the canopy could be jettisoned using a backup supply of compressed air. This was controlled by the second, larger handle. It also had two operating modes: emergency opening and emergency jettison.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/f1de1ffe78eeb0b0c2c62e6beb1d005a1866abad.png\"][\/img][\/p][p]While we're on the subject of emergency controls, we should also mention the T-shaped emergency landing gear extension handle, located a little farther down.[\/p][p]In general, the Panther's controls were grouped quite logically.[\/p][p]On the central instrument panel in front of the pilot were familiar instruments such as the airspeed indicator, vertical speed indicator, and other flight and navigation instruments found in most of the aircraft in our project. There's little point in going through them all in detail again. Perhaps the only one worth mentioning is the remote compass indicator, which looked quite different from the compasses used in land-based aircraft.[\/p][p]Another interesting feature of the Panther's central instrument panel\u2014one that had also become characteristic of naval aviation from the second half of World War II onward\u2014was indirect instrument lighting.[\/p][p]Unlike on land-based aircraft, an additional panel fitted with lamps was mounted over the instrument panel. These lamps illuminated the space between the two panels, providing lighting for the instruments.[\/p][p]If you look closely at the panel, you'll see numerous identical protrusions that resemble bolts\u2014these are the lamp sockets. You may recognize this type of lighting from Soviet aircraft of World War II, such as the LaGG-3 and La-5, which used a similar system.[\/p][p]And the last noteworthy feature of the central panel is the tail hook control handle, used for carrier landings. You can see it on the right-hand side.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/6c03176115a1e67337ac06fd1ca9a225e55eef62.png\"][\/img][\/p][p][\/p][p]The left console housed the throttle, indicators for the aircraft's high-lift devices, and controls for the flaps, landing gear, and trim tabs, as you'd expect. It also housed the diluter demand oxygen regulator, which controlled the oxygen supply to the pilot.[\/p][p]There were also gauges showing the quantity and pressure of the water used to boost engine power.[\/p][p]Slightly lower and farther aft was a red emergency brake handle. This console also housed an emergency handle for returning the ejection seat to its proper position for ejection, along with some of the fuel system controls.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/a1b7bab3f68f4da505d43b5c8ec5ca3eeed1ea98.png\"][\/img][\/p][p]The remaining fuel system controls were located on the right-hand side. Also on the right were the electrical system and cockpit lighting controls. A bank of circuit breakers was mounted on the vertical sidewall, while the horizontal console housed controls for various radio systems: the radio compass, communications radio, and identification friend or foe (IFF) transponder.[\/p][p]A pair of hydraulic pressure gauges was located there as well.[\/p][p]Farther aft on the same side were additional controls unique to carrier-based aircraft: the wing-fold controls, essential when space aboard an aircraft carrier is very limited.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/9675d3b0692d34e185bb8958e2b274daaeb51410.png\"][\/img][\/p][p]Behind the pilot, on the canopy glazing, was the radio compass's sense antenna, similar to those found on other aircraft of the Blue side.[\/p][p]Another interesting feature of this aircraft was the placement of the ejection handles, which resembled ropes on a sailing ship, at the top of the headrest. To eject, the pilot pulled the handles downward, drawing a special face curtain out of the headrest to shield his face from the oncoming airflow.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/e09ac2a1a2f27de38e47b08b297cde48b82d5ace.png\"][\/img][\/p][p]And that concludes our look at the cockpit of the first carrier-based aircraft in [i]Korea[\/i]. Although many of its features will be familiar from other aircraft already in the game, it has some interesting distinguishing characteristics unique to this new type of operation.[\/p][p]For more on these distinctive features and, more generally, all the work involved in bringing something as exciting as carrier aviation to the simulator, keep following our Dev Blogs.[\/p][p]The further we go, the more exciting things get.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][p]Please subscribe to our channels: [url=\"https:\/\/discord.gg\/QksFqpX7Uy\"]Discord[\/url], [url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/IL2Series\"]Facebook[\/url], [url=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@il2_sturmovik\"]YouTube[\/url], [url=\"https:\/\/www.reddit.com\/r\/IL2Series\/\"]Reddit[\/url], and [url=\"https:\/\/x.com\/il2series\"]X[\/url]. Share the news, and ask questions![\/p][p]Stay tuned![\/p][p]Good hunting![\/p]","commentcount":5,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1691520782_1793117092_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"565923725076105112","event_gid":"712290127331728395","voteupcount":108,"votedowncount":1,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"565923725076105112","rtime32_last_modified":1793391949,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793117092,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793101454,"votes_up":108,"votes_down":1,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"804592995637698493","gidfeature2":"565923725076105112"},{"gid":"703282384630450941","clan_steamid":"103582791475538230","event_name":"Dev Blog #90: Water","event_type":28,"appid":247970,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792513560,"rtime32_end_time":1792517100,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Improved water, coastlines and more to come.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"\u041d\u043e\u0432\u0430\u044f \u0432\u043e\u0434\u0430, \u0431\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0432\u0430\u044f \u043b\u0438\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0438 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0443\u0449\u0438\u0435 \u0443\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"15c5a595af305e307a8b9d51cb0d4d4e7711b1d7.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"70a1de7f2c2663735eed13e4fced0b695c928828.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"156594cd8a0c7de1a69cf54273c269e26672fe6f.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"056223783a965b7f7cab24f9e38583c6863e0e8c.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"clone_from_event_gid\":\"719044258722483679\",\"clone_from_sale_enabled\":false,\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"703282384630450942","clanid":"46016822","posterid":"0","headline":"Dev Blog #90: Water","posttime":1792513591,"updatetime":1792513591,"body":"[p][b]Greetings, comrades![\/b][\/p][p][\/p][p]We are hard at work on the first expansion for [i]Korea: IL-2 Series[\/i]\u2014[i]Deck Ops[\/i]. We have already told you a little about this expansion in our Dev Blogs: for example, in [url=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/news\/app\/247970\/view\/719043624313030861?l=english\"]Dev Blog #88[\/url], you can read about the Panther. In future issues, we will be sharing more and more information about the expansion, its aircraft, and new gameplay possibilities.[\/p][p]But today, we have decided to talk about the changes being made ahead of its release. These changes will become especially important when [i]Deck Ops[\/i] arrives. Some of them have already been included in recent updates, while others will appear in upcoming ones.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/e9fdce03ffb329a6a8cfe5020feca3ccf5b0888f.png\"][\/img][\/p][p]At present, [i]Korea[\/i] focuses primarily on ground operations and everything associated with them. This focus has therefore shaped our priorities when developing the game world.[\/p][p]Everything related to operations on water was developed based on what players encounter during flights. We created high-quality water surface rendering technology and an extensive range of highly detailed surface targets with a sophisticated damage system. You can read about all these features in detail in \u0434\u043d\u0435\u0432\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0435 \u211647. Even at release, the level of detail of ships and other surface vessels was unprecedented for a flight simulator.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/30ccb9415f3fd97f48f32917a83094b7bc575258.png\"][\/img][\/p][p][\/p][p]With this expansion, players will not only fly along the coastline and attack surface targets, but also land on and take off from an aircraft carrier. As a result, players will pay much more attention to everything related to water. That is why, for an expansion so closely tied to the sea, we have begun raising the level of detail in the game's waters and coastal areas.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][carousel][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/0464ff6b7cab21ea7f4d89771353074a27895b7c.png\"][\/img][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/063641b68fd45d4b193157dd7dc95fba8abcbf22.png\"][\/img][\/carousel][p]We briefly mentioned before that our water rendering technology has already undergone significant changes since release. In addition to improving the water surface itself, we have enhanced how everything beneath it is rendered. This has dramatically transformed the coastline. The seabed, its contours, and objects resting on it are now visible through the water, along with shadows cast by ships and piers. All of this creates a more natural-looking scene.[\/p][p]But these changes are not as simple as they might seem. Alongside major technological improvements, we also had to do considerable work on the game's content. Previously, the coastline, piers, and other objects had not been designed with a visible seabed in mind. So, after making the technical changes, we had to rework the geometry of the entire coastline and add detail to shallow-water areas and numerous coastal objects.[\/p][p]And that is no easy task when you are dealing not just with satellite data, but with historical locations that, as we have explained many times before, have to be recreated by hand using historical records.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][carousel][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/7f35bff1511d6836f431a27a6b7a08dbd29666b7.png\"][\/img][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/eced0fd456c025c13f3c5f03f28ef1bec0ba1f00.png\"][\/img][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/1de77969610fd927d771aeb4448bcee279065cad.png\"][\/img][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/ea973445ee0cfac3cf89a1adbf938c3efa5012b3.png\"][\/img][\/carousel][p][\/p][p]Besides the coastline, we are also improving effects on the water surface.[\/p][p]Ship wakes, for example, have changed dramatically. They are now three-dimensional: instead of being merely projected onto the water's surface, they also change its visible geometry. Previously, three-dimensional waves appeared only near a ship's bow. Now the entire wake has volume and remains clearly visible even against reflections.[\/p][p]This is especially noticeable when looking across the water at a shallow angle: the wake stands out because of the changes in the surface geometry. You can see the waves a ship generates as it moves through the water. This is particularly important, for example, when approaching an aircraft carrier for landing.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][carousel][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/79ecf61f8e4e7c7a92613bcf0251aad9b4bbd83f.png\"][\/img][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/d0b89fff959edf9b8aee84ace2c0a734def612a2.png\"][\/img][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46016822\/80065771b52f00bbc8521ca0ee36b59b14d62b31.png\"][\/img][\/carousel][p][\/p][p]But the improvements already in the game are not everything we believe is needed for the project and its first expansion.[\/p][p]We also plan to improve other water-related effects, including explosions, various impacts, wave crests, and objects and aircraft falling into the water.[\/p][p]However, these changes deserve a Dev Blog issue of their own. We will tell you more about them when the work is nearing completion.[\/p][p]Besides water-related improvements, we are preparing many other changes. For example, work continues on further optimizing the game. We will soon introduce a new grass rendering technology. Grass will look the same, but performance will improve: FPS near the ground will increase by 15\u201330%, depending on camera angle and settings.[\/p][p]We are also working on significant changes to the graphics subsystem's stereoscopic rendering pipeline. The new approach will noticeably improve VR performance in situations where it is limited by CPU processing power. At the same time, we are working on other optimizations that, together, will significantly improve graphics performance in [i]Korea[\/i] in the near future.[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][p]To make sure you do not miss future stories, we would also like to remind you of our other communication channels, which some of you may find more convenient: [url=\"https:\/\/discord.gg\/QksFqpX7Uy\"]Discord[\/url], [url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/IL2Series\"]Facebook[\/url], [url=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@il2_sturmovik\"]YouTube[\/url], [url=\"https:\/\/www.reddit.com\/r\/IL2Series\/\"]Reddit[\/url], and [url=\"https:\/\/x.com\/il2series\"]X[\/url].[\/p][p]Please subscribe, share the news with your comrades, join the discussion, and ask questions.[\/p][p][\/p][p]Stay tuned![\/p][p]Good luck in battle![\/p]","commentcount":7,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1691520782_1792515565_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"574930130477205020","event_gid":"703282384630450941","voteupcount":141,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"574930130477205020","rtime32_last_modified":1793400549,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792515566,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792509663,"votes_up":141,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"804592995637698493","gidfeature2":"574930130477205020"},{"gid":"719044258722483636","clan_steamid":"103582791475538230","event_name":"Update 1.005","event_type":12,"appid":247970,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1791908220,"rtime32_end_time":1791912601,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"AI improvements and a new wingman behavior setting\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"\u0423\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0418\u0418 \u0438 \u043d\u043e\u0432\u0430\u044f \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0432\u0435\u0434\u043e\u043c\u044b\u0445\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"Improved combat AI, a new wingman behavior setting, and a MiG-15 training mission, plus bug fixes and cockpit lighting improvements.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"\u0423\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0418\u0418 \u0432 \u0432\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0443\u0448\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0431\u043e\u044e, \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0432\u0435\u0434\u043e\u043c\u044b\u0445 \u0438 \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0447\u043d\u0430\u044f \u043c\u0438\u0441\u0441\u0438\u044f \u0434\u043b\u044f \u041c\u0438\u0413-15. \u0418\u0441\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u043e\u0448\u0438\u0431\u043e\u043a \u0438 \u0434\u043e\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u043a\u0438 \u043e\u0441\u0432\u0435\u0449\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u043a\u0430\u0431\u0438\u043d.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"15c5a595af305e307a8b9d51cb0d4d4e7711b1d7.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"70a1de7f2c2663735eed13e4fced0b695c928828.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"c2d05001ad9386cfb6c99dd1c4f8147dab216a53.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"5b8001494bd8d311d6dc4412eba5827669aa0103.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"clone_from_event_gid\":\"719043624313029617\",\"clone_from_sale_enabled\":false}","announcement_body":{"gid":"719044258722483637","clanid":"46016822","posterid":"0","headline":"Update 1.005","posttime":1791907414,"updatetime":1791909861,"body":"[p]Hello, pilots![\/p][p][\/p][p]Today, we\u2019re bringing you update 1.005. In this version, we\u2019ve improved AI behavior in air combat, introduced a wingman behavior setting, and added a MiG-15 training mission. We\u2019ve also fixed issues affecting aircraft, missions, and multiplayer, improved cockpit lighting and visual effects, and updated the game\u2019s protection system.[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]AI AND AUTOPILOT[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][list][*][p]Added an AI wingmen behavior option to the Game section of Settings. By default, wingmen follow the mission scenario until they receive a command from the player. With the alternative setting selected, they remain in formation with the player until ordered otherwise.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Improved target prioritization during air combat.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Improved AI maneuver selection and aiming during head-on attacks.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Improved selection of evasive maneuvers when under attack.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed control surface jitter on AI-controlled aircraft during air combat.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed several issues that could cause the autopilot to stop working after being switched on and off repeatedly.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed taxiing for piston-engine aircraft at K-19 Haeju airfield.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][\/p][p][b]MISSIONS AND TRAINING[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][list][*][p]Added a MiG-15 training mission: \u201cExercise 1 \u2014 Orbiting.\u201d\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue in Strategic Object Cover missions where the mission could be marked as failed despite all objectives being completed.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][\/p][p][b]AIRCRAFT AND GROUND VEHICLES[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][list][*][p]Fixed jet engines sometimes shutting down after a time skip involving a significant change in altitude.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]IL-10: fixed an issue that prevented the engine from starting with the Fuel System Helper disabled and the fuel shutoff valve open.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]F-80C-10: fixed an issue that allowed the engine to start with the Fuel System Helper disabled and the fuel shutoff valve closed.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Reduced the severity of collisions between aircraft wheels and airfield lights.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed the sinking physics of vehicles that entered the water upside down.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed collision physics for tracked vehicles, including the IS-2, ISU-122, M19, M46, and M6 Tractor.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Added a new AI-controlled object: a pontoon boat.[\/p][p][\/p][\/*][*][p]Il-10 \u2014 corrected the phosphorescent illumination of cockpit labels and instrument scales. [\/p][\/*][\/list][p][\/p][p][b]MULTIPLAYER[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][list][*][p]Fixed an issue that could cause AI-controlled aircraft in large formations to stop responding to mission commands.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Removed incorrect mud effects and wheel tracks when AI-controlled vehicles travel on concrete.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][\/p][p][b]CONTROLS[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][list][*][p]Changed the default key binding for toggling navigation lights from Win + L to LShift + L to avoid a conflict with a Windows system shortcut. This binding is applied automatically on a fresh installation. If you are updating an existing installation, you need to change the binding manually.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][\/p][p][b]INTERFACE AND MUSEUM[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][list][*][p]Fixed taxi waypoint indicators after a manual landing.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed destruction messages that omitted the object\u2019s model name.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Yak-9P: corrected the IKO-42 heading indicator description in Russian and English.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Yak-9P: added the commands for adjusting gunsight brightness to the gunsight lamp rheostat description in the Museum.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][\/p][p][b]GRAPHICS AND ENVIRONMENT[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][list][*][p]Fixed cockpit floodlight brightness.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed nighttime lighting in the cockpits of all aircraft.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed bright outlines around submerged parts of objects.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Reworked the ejection effect.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Improved destruction effects for medium-sized and very large buildings.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed the train wheel sparks effect.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed arrow directions on \u201cLeft\u201d and \u201cRight\u201d signs.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][\/p][p][b]MISSION AND VIDEO CREATION TOOLS[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][list][*][p]The PlayVoice trigger now supports localization.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Telemetry output for video creation now includes data from AI-controlled aircraft.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][\/p][p][b]OTHER CHANGES[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][list][*][p]Restored support for special characters in login email addresses, including the \u201c+\u201d symbol.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Updated the protection system used by the game and dedicated server.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]Thank you for your feedback, suggestions, and observations! Your reports help us make the game better. Jump in, try out the update, and let us know what you think. See you in the skies over Korea![\/p][p]\nBest regards, \nKorea. IL-2 Series Team[\/p]","commentcount":4,"tags":["patchnotes","mod_reviewed","ModAct_1691520782_1791911467_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"585062631125197871","event_gid":"719044258722483636","voteupcount":71,"votedowncount":2,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"585062631125197871","rtime32_last_modified":1792867075,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1791911467,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1791893004,"votes_up":71,"votes_down":2,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"804592995637698493","gidfeature2":"585062631125197871"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["712290127331728396","703282384630450942"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1791908220,"event_gid":"719044258722483636","announcement_gid":"719044258722483637","clan_account_id":46016822}}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


				<div class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 300px;">			<div class="game_area_description" data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}">
				<h2>EDITIONS</h2>				<p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/d30ab7dddf9ad73ccc08437ac41b5906.avif?t=1787344656" width=748 height=894 /></span></p></p>
			</div>
						<div class="game_area_description" data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}">
				<h2>DELUXE EDITION</h2>				<p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/ea78e7d6112b74a916b3b13ce2f8d9f7.avif?t=1787344656" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras_big/ea78e7d6112b74a916b3b13ce2f8d9f7.avif?t=1787344656 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p>
			</div>
			</div>				<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/0bf749411850b8b1dba00107c5e15b58.avif?t=1787344656" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Korea. IL-2 Series takes you to a pivotal moment in aviation history—a time when jet engines changed the skies forever. During the Korean War, the piston-engine aircraft of a bygone era clashed with the first jet fighters.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >For the first time in the series, gamepads are supported in addition to joysticks and HOTAS control systems.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/59c3d59cae557637b470533d37e6ff5f.poster.avif?t=1787344656" width=1170 height=494 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/59c3d59cae557637b470533d37e6ff5f.webm?t=1787344656" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/59c3d59cae557637b470533d37e6ff5f.mp4?t=1787344656" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >With a massive combat map, authentically recreated aircraft, and a well-crafted balance between simulation and accessibility, every dogfight is brought to life.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Become an ace, fight in legendary machines, or aim even higher and become a regiment’s commander. Lead squadrons, plot routes across the combat map, and issue orders to turn the tide of history. In the skies of Korea, you can be anyone: from a rank-and-file pilot to a strategist shaping the outcome of the campaign.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>For the first time in the IL-2 series, full controller support has been implemented.</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/c024ce81057a341cf22d6d895eb8bef0.avif?t=1787344656" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >The aircraft of the Korean War have been recreated based on actual blueprints, historical photographs, flight manuals, and other archival materials. There are eight* aircraft at your disposal.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><i>*Please note La‑11 and F‑84E Thunderjet are available in the Premium and Deluxe editions, or as a separate DLC.</i></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><i> </i> </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/d0da77dd71852b853f00b7d97d519a50.avif?t=1787344656" width=780 height=1388 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every instrument in the cockpit is fully functional and reflects the state of the aircraft’s systems in real time. You will be aiming and firing just as pilots did 75 years ago.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/177a0346e95cf4dc5549bc2bf6184103.poster.avif?t=1787344656" width=1170 height=494 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/177a0346e95cf4dc5549bc2bf6184103.webm?t=1787344656" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/177a0346e95cf4dc5549bc2bf6184103.mp4?t=1787344656" type="video/mp4"></video></span> </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/1a50fd06f5ee6dfa5b8d1c4e0ddc67e4.avif?t=1787344656" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >The game takes place on the largest map in the series' history, covering an area of over 200,000 square kilometers. The Korean Peninsula has been recreated based on historical maps and documents from the 1950s. All significant historical landscape changes have been accounted for, including reclaimed coastal areas and shoreline changes.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >The map features dozens of airbases with historically accurate layouts, hundreds of settlements, and strategic objectives such as ports, dams, and transport hubs.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/f2ca5a9b9c7a91897be594d89580eaef.poster.avif?t=1787344656" width=1170 height=494 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/f2ca5a9b9c7a91897be594d89580eaef.webm?t=1787344656" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/f2ca5a9b9c7a91897be594d89580eaef.mp4?t=1787344656" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/c0927bdfe4978e91004cbffa4a5019e1.avif?t=1787344656" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >The Home by Christmas campaign tells the story of Captain Jack Russell, who in 1950 secures a transfer to a combat unit fighting in the Korean War to fulfill his dream of becoming a jet ace.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >You will fly 15 historically accurate combat missions, recreated from the combat logs of the 8th Fighter-Bomber Wing and the memoirs of its pilots.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >The campaign reflects unique challenges of the war's early months: jet aircraft could not operate from small forward airstrips, so some pilots had to temporarily return to piston-engined machines. Over the course of the campaign, you will fly both the F-51 Mustang and the F-80 Shooting Star jet.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/37b219f118edb783be855d07df4145e0.poster.avif?t=1787344656" width=1170 height=494 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/37b219f118edb783be855d07df4145e0.webm?t=1787344656" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/37b219f118edb783be855d07df4145e0.mp4?t=1787344656" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/24c2212fd256826103f8ec767843b285.avif?t=1787344656" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >In Career mode, you will act as an air regiment commander, managing personnel and overseeing aviation logistics.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >It is up to you to decide whether to take to the skies or focus on strategic tasks. As a regiment commander, you will maintain combat readiness, plan operations, and reinforce your units.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/4aecf2908ec423c02dd408bec83d12ef.poster.avif?t=1787344656" width=1170 height=494 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/4aecf2908ec423c02dd408bec83d12ef.webm?t=1787344656" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/4aecf2908ec423c02dd408bec83d12ef.mp4?t=1787344656" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/41c5cfd98e87673f2fcdcdc4a6d52dfa.avif?t=1787344656" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Korea features a highly detailed damage model for both aviation and ground objects. Aircraft, including strategic bombers, as well as ground vehicles, trains, and ships, receive damage corresponding to the nature of the hits sustained.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every object reacts realistically to collisions, crashes, and combat damage, taking into account mass, speed, and the point of impact, directly affecting the behavior of the vehicle and the outcome of the battle.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e06e5d387bc7bd7e16de8d410c9ecd11.poster.avif?t=1787344656" width=1170 height=494 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e06e5d387bc7bd7e16de8d410c9ecd11.webm?t=1787344656" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e06e5d387bc7bd7e16de8d410c9ecd11.mp4?t=1787344656" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/cb6938d3c9800e69b1801ab3533b052c.avif?t=1787344656" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >In this new mode, you can examine each aircraft, ground vehicle, and naval vessel in detail. Explore the models, learn about their development and combat history, inspect aircraft cockpits, and compare technical specs, including detailed performance charts.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Your own personal museum, open anytime—a true treasure for anyone passionate about aviation and military history.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/d09c5c9f1d40902653201556a484e6dd.poster.avif?t=1787344656" width=1170 height=494 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/d09c5c9f1d40902653201556a484e6dd.webm?t=1787344656" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/d09c5c9f1d40902653201556a484e6dd.mp4?t=1787344656" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/9d6232f47caceb16ab9c0b1be0314f9a.avif?t=1787344656" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >For the first time in the series, you can leave the cockpit and walk around the airfield where your regiment is based.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Animations of the people—pilots, soldiers, and civilians—were created using motion capture (MOCAP) technology, ensuring natural and lifelike movement.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e7bd9b7381e22e82785f30a1d148f480.poster.avif?t=1787344656" width=1170 height=494 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e7bd9b7381e22e82785f30a1d148f480.webm?t=1787344656" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e7bd9b7381e22e82785f30a1d148f480.mp4?t=1787344656" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Designed for full immersion:</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Full VR support via OpenXR and OpenVR.</strong></p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Accessibility:</strong> The game features detailed systems management, but there’s no need to memorize engine start-up sequences—you can take off and engage immediately. </p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Hardware support:</strong> From controllers to desktop joysticks and professional HOTAS systems.</p></li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					Generative technologies are used in Korea. IL-2 Series as production tools for selected types of content: in-game radio communications, pilot portraits and images used in Career mode.<br />
<br />
Radio communications use text-to-speech technology based on voice recordings made by our team and voice actors under the relevant agreements.<br />
<br />
Pilot portraits and Career mode images are created with AI-assisted workflows based on our own assets, in-game screenshots, models, and historical references, then manually reviewed and refined by our artists.<br />
<br />
Generative AI is not used as a replacement for creative direction. All such content is curated, checked, and finalized by the development team.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse sys_req" style="max-height: 300px;">
		<h2>System Requirements</h2>
				<div class="sysreq_contents">
