											<div class="game_area_sys_req_leftCol">
							<ul>
								<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4-Core CPU 3.6+ GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 24 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 Gb Graphics Card no more than 2 generations old (RTX 3060 or RX 7600 level)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 35 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR or Steam VR supported headsets. VR Controllers are not supported.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Gamepad or Joystick are recommended</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
																<div class="game_area_sys_req_rightCol">
							<ul>
								<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8-Core CPU 4.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 12+ Gb Graphics Card (RTX 4080 or 7900 XTX level)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 35 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR or Steam VR headsets (16+ Gb Current Gen Graphics Card recommended). VR Controllers are not supported.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Joystick or HOTAS system are recommended</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
